  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Knowledge Sector (Cambodia)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of this program is to strengthen the capacity of knowledge sector institutions to undertake quality research that informs public policy analysis and dialogue in Cambodia. This goal will be realised through mutually reinforcing activities conducted under four program objectives:
1) Increase understanding of Cambodia&apos;s knowledge sector
2) Strengthen the capacity and networking of established knowledge sector institutions
3) Support research by emerging knowledge sector actors through an Emerging Research Fund
4) Promote thoughtful and inclusive policy dialogue and analysis.</narrative>
  </description>
